[[4,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on the lifting bridge.</p><p>Disconnect battery pole (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3237701\">1072D10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237529\">1048A34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a></p><p>Slacken fixing clamps of sleeves joining\nto modular inlet manifold.</p><p>Remove sleeves from inlet manifold.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2014177.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[4,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Insert the four  sleeves joining chamber\nto inlet manifold and tighten its fixing clamps.</p><p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237529\">1048A34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237701\">1072D10</a></p><p>Connect battery terminal (-).</p>"]]